                ],
                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "f47fa70b-45e9-30df-9983-06c3d3363fd2",
                        "entry_id": "194f318e-ed2b-3648-9e32-fa2104cb3147",
                        "glosses": [
                            "bothersome"
                        ],
                        "tags": [],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "e7574630-6232-4b95-b192-8fa8b4385d1a",
                                "sense_id": "f47fa70b-45e9-30df-9983-06c3d3363fd2",
                                "text": "Я стара́лся каза́ться весёлым и равноду́шным, да́бы не пода́ть никако́го подозре́ния и избе́гнуть доку́чных вопро́сов; но, призна́юсь, я не име́л того́ хладнокро́вия, кото́рым хва́лятся почти́ всегда́ те, кото́рые находи́лись в моём положе́нии.",
                                "translation": "I tried to appear cheerful and unconcerned, so as not to excite suspicion, and to escape importunate questions; but I own I did not feel as unconcerned as persons in my position usually boast themselves to be.",
                                "english": "I tried to appear cheerful and unconcerned, so as not to excite suspicion, and to escape importunate questions; but I own I did not feel as unconcerned as persons in my position usually boast themselves to be."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
